  "body": "### Summary\n\nAs a reader, I want the last two Liquid Glass leftovers of #545 to match the rest of the app: the smiley picker's search options and the topic-search progress panel float on glass like the other bars and panels, and the code pointers name their GAP rows. (Status check of #545, 2026-11-18.)\n\n### Scope\n\n- `App/SwiftHFR/Smileys/SmileyPickerView.swift:55,146-155`: `safeAreaInset(edge: .bottom)` + `.background(.bar)` → `.safeAreaBar(edge: .bottom, spacing: 0)` with no fill, the pattern of `Composer/Gif/GifPickerView.swift:22` (#856).\n- `App/SwiftHFR/Reader/Search/TopicSearchSheet.swift:44`: `.background(.regularMaterial, in: .rect(cornerRadius: 14))` → `.glassEffect(in: .rect(cornerRadius: 12))`, as `ReaderAlertFlow.swift:15` and `ReaderEditFlow.swift:16` (GAP-221 loading overlay).\n- Replace the 8 \"GAP row pending #545\" comments with the row ids (GAP-221 pagers/banner/toast, GAP-224 symbols, GAP-226 buttons): `FilteredPostsView.swift:10`, `MessageListView.swift:6`, `PagerToolbar.swift:5`, `TopicListView.swift:8`, `ImageViewerView.swift:8`, `RootTabsView.swift:8`, `ForumSearchView.swift:9`, `SmileyPickerView.swift:5`.\n- Apple system APIs only (no custom blur or material, #1070).\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Both surfaces use the system glass as above; simulator screenshots before/after of the smiley sheet while searching and the topic search sheet while searching: light, dark, Reduce Transparency, Increase Contrast; iPhone and iPad.\n- [ ] No \"GAP row pending #545\" left in `App/SwiftHFR`.\n- [ ] Whole `SwiftHFRTests` target green; SwiftLint green.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
